# netclaw provider — provider management TUI
Output screenshots/output/provider.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set FontSize 16
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "netclaw provider"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Screenshot screenshots/output/provider-manager.png
Sleep 500ms

Escape
Sleep 1s
